hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"278","Ahmad bin Abi Surayj Al-Razi told us, Abu Ahmad told us, Al-Minhal bin Khalifa told us, on the authority of Khaled bin Salamah, on the authority of Mujahid, on the authority of Umm Salamah, she said, or it was said to her: What did you do with your clothes when you menstruated during the time of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace? She said: “If we were to menstruate in our clothes and in our armor, we would not wash from them except traces of blood, and the servant is one of your servants today.” So that the day of her purification may be devoted to washing her clothes.”"
